{"text": "Tu savais que Pluton a un énorme cœur blanc sur sa surface ? En juillet deux mille quinze, la sonde New Horizons a photographié Pluton de près, et tout le monde a remarqué ce grand cœur, il a été baptisé Tombaugh Regio, en hommage à l'astronome qui a découvert Pluton, sa partie gauche est un immense glacier de glace d'azote, plus grand que la France, et cette glace bouge lentement, comme sur Terre, ce qui prouve que Pluton est encore active. Abonne-toi pour d'autres histoires sur l'univers, et envoie la vidéo à quelqu'un que ça va faire rêver.", "voice": {"id": "TojRWZatQyy9dujEdiQ1", "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2", "tempo": 1.1, "api_speed": 1.1}, "starts": [0.0, 0.104, 0.163, 0.209, 0.244, 0.348, 0.395, 0.43, 0.453, 0.476, 0.511, 0.534, 0.569, 0.615, 0.662, 0.72, 0.778, 0.836, 0.917, 1.022, 1.068, 1.103, 1.126, 1.149, 1.184, 1.231, 1.335, 1.393, 1.474, 1.579, 1.637, 1.695, 1.753, 1.8, 1.858, 1.904, 1.962, 1.997, 2.067, 2.125, 2.183, 2.241, 2.287, 2.322, 2.345, 2.38, 2.45, 2.485, 2.519, 2.566, 2.624, 2.682, 2.717, 2.786, 2.844, 2.902, 3.019, 3.088, 3.228, 3.262, 3.297, 3.413, 3.495, 3.541, 3.599, 3.646, 3.75, 3.785, 3.831, 3.855, 3.913, 3.947, 4.005, 4.04, 4.087, 4.11, 4.133, 4.156, 4.203, 4.272, 4.296, 4.319, 4.342, 4.389, 4.423, 4.458, 4.563, 4.621, 4.679, 4.783, 4.807, 4.946, 5.004, 5.062, 5.12, 5.178, 5.317, 5.352, 5.457, 5.492, 5.573, 5.619, 5.677, 5.712, 5.759, 5.782, 5.828, 5.886, 5.991, 6.049, 6.13, 6.188, 6.304, 6.56, 6.664, 6.722, 6.78, 6.838, 6.885, 6.954, 7.024, 7.07, 7.129, 7.175, 7.245, 7.291, 7.326, 7.349, 7.407, 7.465, 7.523, 7.581, 7.651, 7.721, 7.755, 7.814, 7.86, 7.906, 7.964, 8.022, 8.104, 8.173, 8.278, 8.313, 8.533, 8.603, 8.638, 8.684, 8.719, 8.766, 8.789, 8.824, 8.847, 8.87, 8.905, 8.951, 8.986, 9.044, 9.091, 9.149, 9.172, 9.195, 9.218, 9.276, 9.323, 9.392, 9.439, 9.509, 9.578, 9.636, 9.671, 9.729, 9.787, 9.834, 9.88, 9.938, 9.985, 10.043, 10.089, 10.112, 10.136, 10.182, 10.263, 10.368, 10.449, 10.553, 10.635, 10.797, 10.902, 10.